value = "# Text BETA — 2019/01/24\012\012## Questions for future expansion\012\012* Can I go outside of the current bBox? Things like the Vietnamese combining accents could really do with a bit more room to breath in the Text master(s).\012\012\012# Individual Elements\012\012comma – changed the length of the descender to be more defined.\012\012\012# Axis\012\012## 1 Weight\012\012ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ\012abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\0120123456789\012.,?! - – —\012\012## 2 Optical Size\012\012—\012\012## 3 Spacing\012\012ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ\012abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\0120123456789\012.,?! - – —\012\012## 4 Character Width\012\012BCDEGLOQR	S\012\012ehkmnr tu vwy\012\0120\012\012## 5 Ascender\012\012bdfhijkl\012\012## 6 Counter\012\012CG JS\012\012aceg	 s\012\0121235679 (1 4 5 6 9 changing after 50)\012?";
